# Started by hand (ssh, a script): no launcher contract variables and no input.state (APP-CONTRACT section 7). The app
# still starts, sizes itself from the layout service and keeps the keyboard rule "auto" with its own probe.
title RSS Reader: started without the launcher
nocontract
env RSSREADER_DATA /tmp/rss-reader-scene-data
sizes 640x480 720x720

wait 900
shot home-nocontract
expect text "Browse feeds"
key esc
wait 300
key right
key enter
expect quit
